{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9a4d9ebacc51b20ff25e5b1c8d551084ecce78183eea6cb395ca502d6ca67cd4", "ja": "（翼が出演した、お正月の鬼ごっこ特番が大好評！\nシリーズ化が決まり、今日は予告PVの撮影だ）", "zh": "（翼出演的新年鬼抓人特别节目大受好评！系列化已经确定，今天要拍摄预告PV了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d4027f199ae12c0a3d3f71bf3f41d2f5a26e048d04f15e6c7b2e82b962ae68a2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様でーす。\n撮影終わりました～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦～\n拍摄结束了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1002_p", "source_sha256": "33ac5a192208f1f2ce8dd872274a74b409529cefd7c528c7bb9ac15652be7cda", "ja": "お疲れ様、翼。\n今日の予告PV撮影、バッチリだったじゃないか。", "zh": "辛苦了，翼。今天的预告PV拍摄，表现得相当不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0b660569ff83b1a305cc2a242bb4e7199bce68c3dd1beadf1c09fbf5cbf8769c", "ja": "えへへ♪　お正月は逃げてばっかりで目立てなかった\nから、今度こそ～って、気合い入ってるんでーす♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　过年的时候一直光顾着逃跑，没能好好表现，\n所以这次一定要——我可是卯足了劲呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1004_p", "source_sha256": "069cf3e12fc9b9cee06982730a579c5a6770ece41a34d651c4e1b18324fbadbf", "ja": "そうか、翼に気合いが……！　でも、お正月にロコの\n罠にかかってもがいてた翼も、かなり目立ってたぞ？", "zh": "这样啊，翼干劲十足啊……！不过，新年里中了ROCO的陷阱、挣扎不已的翼，也相当引人注目哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c7cf0fe75ad91336777db9098c54d6cd806c205c3e604e49cf8198b0cb2593b8", "ja": "あんな目立ち方、イヤですよ～。\nカッコ悪いし、ちょっと恥ずかしかったし……。", "zh": "我才不要那样引人注目呢～。\n既不帅气，还有点丢人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "309c543fbb464bee766af655549a66dc151c03272f2dcfc8082f50e6a3487511", "ja": "どうせならカワイイとか、カッコイイ～って\n言われたいんです！", "zh": "既然这样，我更希望别人说我可爱啊、帅气——之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c92d3097f81cfbc26f7273e892bba40571ebb00ffe6108caa854783153424cd7", "ja": "まあ、そうだよな。確かに今度の『ネズミの逆襲』編\nでは、追いかける側だし、カッコよく目立てそうだ。", "zh": "也是啊。这次在《老鼠的反击》篇里\n确实是追逐的一方，感觉能帅气地大显身手呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2f6adea8ea39c07469fd65cc7105648766715356f531448799b05247e9849ffc", "ja": "そうですよね♪　{$P$}さんも、\nわたしに捕まりたくなっちゃいました？", "zh": "就是这样嘛♪ {$P$}先生也变得想被我抓住了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1009_p", "source_sha256": "466546b33aeb5ab0585ba7ad429509726b3cf0793a1431613a8b0f848eab231f", "ja": "え？　うーん……PVを見たみんなは、そう思うかな。\nそれくらい、今日の翼は良かったぞ！", "zh": "诶？嗯……看过PV的大家，应该会这么想吧。\n今天的小翼表现得那么好，确实有这个程度哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "25f5267f7a3fdea4221eed3364b26b19e5612211a029a3d6eb13a436a75b793d", "ja": "む～……ズルいなぁ。{$P$}さんって\n逃げるの上手ですよね～？", "zh": "唔～……太狡猾了。{$P$}先生你\n很擅长逃避话题呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0cd1cd5bbb71475057134db1219598a32843e82008abd27d229864d5a8c17266", "ja": "ま、いっか。今日はカッコよく撮ってもらえたし。\nわたし、昨日お風呂でキメ顔の練習までしたんですよ♪", "zh": "算了。今天也拍得很帅嘛。\n我昨天甚至还在浴室里练习了帅气的表情哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0ef7ac55755080e923219406dd78fc5bba82fc7d9e770b73eb6c71459021330e", "ja": "そうか、翼が練習を……！　その調子なら、\nこのあとのインタビューも期待できそうだな。", "zh": "这样啊，翼还特意练习了……！照这个状态来看，\n接下来的采访也很值得期待了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "695234c23809c3ff33e0cac66dc4748ba352ad4a3dc496a780ef8925cef409e7", "ja": "え～、まだお仕事あるんですか～？\n今日はもう、いっぱい頑張ったのに～！", "zh": "诶～，还要工作吗～？\n明明今天已经很努力了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7a01ce4c8b5eaf35b95d93abe00d7e865f82ab3f998532c529fb021e56d888b4", "ja": "しまった、やる気はもう使いきっていたのか……。\nええと、ほら、インタビューだから写真も撮るんだ。", "zh": "糟糕，原来干劲已经用光了吗……\n那个，你看，因为是采访，所以还要拍照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cdf16a79e2f2dad445c80ab45de784a7f9140d0d5d2ef068acd83a3f865a628a", "ja": "そのキメ顔でカッコイイ魅力的な翼を、\n写真でバッチリ広めてもらわないと！", "zh": "得把摆出帅气表情、魅力十足的翼，通过照片好好宣传出去才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a8265fa19e94ad51b61a948de56a4f7750262d9542f1a5fb34d86d6af8c47a91", "ja": "む～。じゃあ、もうちょっとだけ頑張りますけど～。\n……その代わり、{$P$}さんっ。", "zh": "唔～。那我就再稍微加把劲好了～\n……作为交换，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0174_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "23e29b52cd1cff6279e037b06b15af0d19fbd622f098abcb38258aff5e809a7c", "ja": "終わったら、ちゃんとわたしに捕まって、\nデートしてくださいね？　約束～っ！", "zh": "结束后，记得乖乖被我抓住，陪我约会哦？说好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
